      "text": "ATHEROSCLEROSIS DRIVES:\n  Coronary artery disease → Stable angina → ACS → MI → HF\n  Cerebrovascular disease → TIA → Stroke\n  Peripheral arterial disease → Claudication → Critical limb ischemia"
    },
